      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ラストレゾナンスをどのタイミングで放ち\r\n他の仲間たちに託すのか……。\r\n\r\nパーティ全員の総力をかけ、あなたの手で世界を救ってください。",
        "official_en": "When is the best time to unleash a Last Resonance\r\nand leave the rest to your allies? That’s for you to\r\ndecide.\r\n\r\nUse your party’s strength to the fullest, and deliver\r\nthe world from darkness!",
        "real_en": "When should you unleash a Last Resonance and leave the rest to your allies...?\r\n\r\nUse the combined strength of your entire party to save the world with your own hands."
      },
